1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,385
You step outside
at noon,

2
00:00:01,385 --> 00:00:03,875
and the sky
goes black.

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,140
The sun's
still blazing.

4
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:07,660
You can still
breathe.

5
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,510
Only the blue
is gone.

6
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,140
That blue
was sunlight

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:13,470
bouncing off
the air itself,

8
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,770
and it was lighting
every shadow.

9
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,460
Now step into
the shade,

10
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,080
and you're
blind,

11
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,130
like driving
into a tunnel.

12
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,740
Shade used to
protect you.

13
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:24,920
Now it
hides you,

14
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,390
even from
drivers.

15
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,320
Back in
the shade,

16
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,520
your eyes
adjust,

17
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:33,570
and stars come
out at noon.

18
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:35,900
Then evening
comes.

19
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,880
No orange,
no glow.

20
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,000
The sun
stays white

21
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,030
almost all
the way down.

22
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,120
It slips into
the sea,

23
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,380
and night
doesn't fall.

24
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,370
It drops.

25
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,380
And in the
morning,

26
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:50,610
the sun
doesn't rise.

27
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:52,550
It switches on.
